## 22. Feature Inventory

- **AI Hazard Classification:** Citizen uploads photo -> AI detects issue (YOLOv8).
- **Fraud Prevention (GPS):** Worker uploads resolution -> Backend validates distance < 500m.
- **Automated Visual Verification:** Worker uploads resolution -> AI matches ORB features to original photo.
- **Live Map:** React Leaflet map displaying pins for all issues.
- **SLA Tracking:** Background cron job automatically escalates tickets older than 72 hours.
- **Immutable Audit Trail:** All state changes are appended to a history array rather than overwriting fields.

